[00:00.000]...
[00:15.935]Hey, what's up?  My old hometown
{"嘿 最近怎样 我亲爱的故乡"}
[00:17.932]Well... I'm doin' okay but not very well, not so well
{"嗯…我过得还行 但不算太好 真的不太好"}
[00:23.924]My life isn't the way I hoped nor I planned for myself
{"如今的生活 既非我所愿 也偏离了最初的设想"}
[00:32.365]Cannot say, but I have to say
{"难以启齿 却不得不讲"}
[00:34.410]Cannot save, what I have had saved for all my time
{"无法挽回 那些我曾用毕生守护的时光"}
[00:39.436]I never make it right without you
{"没有你 我永远无法步入正轨"}
[00:47.135]Home sweet home
{"甜蜜的家园"}
[00:51.344]How do I look like through your eyes?
{"在你眼中 我如今是什么模样？"}
[00:58.935]Am I grown up enough?
{"是否已足够成熟坚强？"}
[01:03.634]Spread my wings, put my soul in them cautiously
{"展开双翼 将灵魂小心翼翼地安放"}
[01:07.398]My dearest childhood won't lie, I know that obviously
{"我最珍贵的童年从不说谎 这点我无比确凿"}
[01:11.450]Now I'm feeling so smooth
{"此刻我感到无比轻盈"}
[01:13.630]Like as I can fly, reachin' for the sky
{"仿佛能展翅翱翔 触碰天际"}
[01:19.421]Open my eyes, see my world
{"睁开双眼 看清我的世界"}
[01:21.773]Hum some melodies
{"哼唱着熟悉旋律"}
[01:23.498]Hear my heart beating so loud 'cause of memories
{"回忆让心跳声震耳欲聋"}
[01:27.469]How many smiles can I get?
{"这一生能收获多少笑容？"}
[01:29.671]While I spend my life even myself out of breath?
{"当我耗尽气力 连呼吸都变得沉重？"}
[01:35.938]By the way, my old hometown
{"对了 我亲爱的故乡"}
[01:37.853]Don't you know how she has been?
{"你可知道她近况如何？"}
[01:39.556]She alright? Is she right?
{"她还好吗？真的好吗？"}
[01:43.884]I know she's a tough girl, but she has a fragile heart too
{"我知道她是个坚强的姑娘 却也藏着脆弱心房"}
[01:52.362]She might say, what I have to say
{"或许她会说出 我难以开口的真相"}
[01:54.379]Wanna save what I could have saved for all my time
{"多想挽回 那些本可守护的旧日时光"}
[01:59.335]You taught us we can live how we are
{"你教会我们 活出真实的模样"}
[02:07.232]Home sweet home
{"甜蜜的家"}
[02:11.183]How do I look like through your eyes?
{"在你眼中我是何种模样？"}
