{"回忆让心跳声震耳欲聋"}
[02:47.439]How many smiles can I get?
{"我能收获多少笑容？"}
[02:49.704]While I spend my life even myself out of breath?
{"当我耗尽此生甚至无法呼吸之时？"}
[02:55.696]You know, it's not a miracle but meant to be
{"你明白，这不是奇迹而是命中注定"}
[02:59.389]No, I can't stop cryin' in joy or by nostalgia
{"不，我止不住喜悦或怀旧的泪水"}
[03:03.518]But I don't care
{"但我不在乎"}
[03:06.721]So don't laugh at me, babe
